{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961980/extras/edf0e46d996017f33e69544bd951e8c4.poster.avif?t=1757647615\" width=620 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961980/extras/edf0e46d996017f33e69544bd951e8c4.webm?t=1757647615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961980/extras/edf0e46d996017f33e69544bd951e8c4.mp4?t=1757647615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This\u00a0</strong>is a wild multiplayer game where a group of FOUR Critters battle it out, head to head, against a pair of TWO ferocious Kollectors in fun and explorable maps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Critters aren\u2019t just running for exercise, one wrong move and they're puppy chow! To escape, they must search the map for  items and build a secret gateway route to safety. Teamwork means survival. The Critters' job is work together, outplay their pursuers, and find a way to <strong>BREAKOUT</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Kollectors' sole life mission is to shut down any hope of escape and make an end to the Critters' Breakout once and for all. Stalk, chase, and use your unique abilities to CAPTURE the adorable Critters before they're able to find their escape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match swings between exploration and heart pounding chases. Every Critter and Kollector in this world has their very own characteristics, special abilities, and powers so be sure to pick your team wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you  be the Hunter or the Hunted?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is Critters\u2019 Breakout!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3961980?t=1757647615","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3961980?t=1757647615","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961980/d765d447018c2deb96ee4ce3f84aef692af4faab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757647615","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961980/d765d447018c2deb96ee4ce3f84aef692af4faab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757647615","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961980/extras/edf0e46d996017f33e69544bd951e8c4.poster.avif?t=1757647615\" width=620 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961980/extras/edf0e46d996017f33e69544bd951e8c4.webm?t=1757647615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961980/extras/edf0e46d996017f33e69544bd951e8c4.mp4?t=1757647615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This\u00a0</strong>is a wild multiplayer game where a group of FOUR Critters battle it out, head to head, against a pair of TWO ferocious Kollectors in fun and explorable maps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Critters aren\u2019t just running for exercise, one wrong move and they're puppy chow! To escape, they must search the map for  items and build a secret gateway route to safety. Teamwork means survival. The Critters' job is work together, 